{
  "declaredLength": 2132,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我叫多連安，\n是個獨立遊戲的創作家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EB591A90235B89FF0C000A662F500B73687ACB904A6232768452754F5C5BB6300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對多邊形的東西特別熟悉喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D591A908A5F6276846771897F72795225719F60895594300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道我指的多邊形是什麼嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E59053621163077684591A908A5F62662F4EC09EBC55CEFF1F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那隻寶可夢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A396BB5BF653EF5922FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3D立體造型？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "003300447ACB9AD49020578BFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就某種意思而言，沒錯。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3167D07A2E610F601D800C8A00FF0C6C92932F300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！我想說的就是\n3D電腦繪圖用的多邊形。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF01621160F38AAA76845C31662F000A0033004496FB81667E6A571675287684591A908A5F62300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳平常玩的遊戲裡登場的那些立體角色，\n也就是我們開發者所謂的模型，<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572800100003110000FF01014F6059B35E735E3873A97684904A623288E1767B5834768490A34E9B7ACB9AD489D28272FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F62115011958B767C800562408B0276846A21578BFF0C00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都是用叫做「多邊形建模」的技術\n呈現出來的喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD662F752853EB505A300C591A908A5F625EFA6A21300D768462808853000A544873FE51FA4F8676845594300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "「多邊形建模」就是藉著\n在3D空間裡組合許多的多邊形，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n來完成想製作的立體造型。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "300C591A908A5F625EFA6A21300D5C31662F85C98457000A5728003300447A7A959388E17D4454088A31591A7684591A908A5F62FF0C00100001BE00000A4F865B8C621060F388FD4F5C76847ACB9AD49020578B300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使用越多的多邊形，\n最後的完成的造型就會越平滑。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F75288D8A591A7684591A908A5F62FF0C000A67005F8C76845B8C621076849020578B5C3167038D8A5E736ED1300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但以前的處理器招架不住太多的多邊形，\n所以當時的造型都稜稜角角的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464EE5524D768486557406566862DB67B64E0D4F4F592A591A7684591A908A5F62FF0C000A62404EE57576664276849020578B90FD7A1C7A1C89D289D276845462300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "據說寶可夢的多邊獸，\n就是透過當時最尖端的技術誕生的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不過，科技是日新月異的東西嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64DA8AAA5BF653EF59227684591A908A7378FF0C000A5C31662F900F904E7576664267005C167AEF7684628088538A95751F7684300200100001BE00000A4E0D904EFF0C79D16280662F65E565B06708757076846771897F561B300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，這時候我就要提出一個請求囉。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C90196642501962115C31898163D051FA4E00500B8ACB6C4256C9300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來交換我的多邊獸和\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的多邊獸吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F864EA463DB62117684591A908A7378548C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684591A908A73785427FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意用<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的多邊獸\n和我的多邊獸交換嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F752800100003110000FF01014F6059B37684591A908A7378000A548C62117684591A908A73784EA463DB55CEFF1F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想交換！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F34EA463DBFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們享受一下多邊獸換多邊獸，\n撲通撲通的超級興奮時刻嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621150114EAB53D74E004E0B591A908A737863DB591A908A7378FF0C000A64B2901A64B2901A76848D857D1A8208596E6642523B561BFF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這就來交換我的多邊獸和\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的多邊獸吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C314F864EA463DB62117684591A908A7378548C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684591A908A73785427FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來交換我的多邊獸和\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的多邊獸嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F864EA463DB62117684591A908A7378548C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B37684591A908A7378561BFF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多邊獸！\n我想交換的是多邊獸啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A908A7378FF01000A621160F34EA463DB7684662F591A908A7378554AFF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哦！？\n滑滑的樣子……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654E6FF01FF1F000A6ED16ED176846A235B5020262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是我送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的驚喜喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F621190017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B376849A5A559C5594300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我讓那隻送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的多邊獸\n攜帶著升級資料。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118B9390A396BB90017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B37684591A908A7378000A651C5E36845753477D1A8CC76599300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以牠就這麼進化成\n多邊獸Ⅱ了喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE572605C3190199EBC903253166210000A591A908A737821614E865594300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看！牠的身體變平滑了對吧。\n能由此看出處理器的性能提升了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770BFF01726076848EAB9AD48B8A5E736ED14E865C0D54273002000A80FD75316B64770B51FA8655740656687684602780FD63D053474E865462300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠在升級後新安裝了人工智能和\n用來開發行星的程式，不過……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260572853477D1A5F8C65B05B8988DD4E864EBA5DE5667A80FD548C000A75284F86958B767C884C661F76847A0B5F0FFF0C4E0D904E2026202600100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠依舊是一隻需要特別照顧的寶可夢。\n這也是牠讓我愛得不得了的地方啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72604F9D820A662F4E0096BB97008981727952257167986776845BF653EF59223002000A90194E5F662F72608B936211611B5F974E0D5F974E867684573065B9554A300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦？\n這光芒該不會是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF1F000A9019514982928A724E0D6703662F2026202600100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也讓多邊獸\n攜帶了升級資料啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8600100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F8B93591A908A7378000A651C5E364E8653477D1A8CC76599554A300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這真是個來自<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的驚喜！\n太感謝這場美妙的寶可夢交換了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019771F662F500B4F8681EA00100003110000FF01014F6059B376849A5A559CFF01000A592A611F8B1D901958347F8E599976845BF653EF59224EA463DB4E86FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好希望多邊獸Ⅱ也繼續升級喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5E0C671B591A908A737821614E5F7E7C7E8C53477D1A5594300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哆嘀嘀。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C65600560030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    }
  ],
